    "design_changes": [
      "Brief and equip managers before the announcement, and state plainly that home days carry no penalty in reviews or promotion. Then check it: compare ratings and promotion rates for people who use home days against those who don't, and publish the result.",
      "Launch it as a 6 to 12 month programme with stated measures (attrition, performance, team feedback) so leaders can adjust the details without it feeling like a takeaway, while signalling the intent is to keep it.",
